{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: If you want a cat that keeps a polite distance, doesn't rub fur on your clothes or try to climb on your bed or lap, but gently witnesses you with a warm presence and imbues your day to day with a magical quality, Juniper is the one. She is polite, tidy, and moves respectfully out of the way with a chirp. Any time there is a string waved her way she will engage enthusiastically, playing is a sure way to bond with her and stave off any built up anxiety. If you speak to her lovingly, she will roll around on the carpet and mew back, stretch her little paws towards you as if she knows you're speaking love to her. She loves calm and silence, that is the environment where her true powers can come to be. If you have a home that is all about peacefulness, she will fit right in.\nShe doesn't love to be pet or snuggled but she will give you a chin bump by her own initiative. She will check on you and sit by your side in a protective stance as you do your work. She has been a gem to us and has made our home warmer and cuter than we ever expected.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=4&searchType=4&animalid=192831","id":"47b6ccdb992ec293d87c1ffcc50a7b4c","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/0733df86f95142058d8d35e696050e85-1775078662-1775078742-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/04269cde413e4c4aaefb5f47aa9f9d28-1775078661-1775078683-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/acd3e2081a804c6b87eef1c5f902c964-1763333048-1775078669-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/53414308f1a64e3f852d15fd2361c7de-1775078663-1775078663-jpg/600---n"